  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Purgatory is a rogue-like gmae. Let me introduce you with some basic info
    about this game.

    In this game, you can level up your character by killing
    enemies and level up your spells by picking up spells XP dropped from enemie
    to unlock incredible power of that kind of spell.

    For spells, you can change
    between fireball, chainlightning, and laser by using scroll-wheel, and when one
    spell reach to lv.6, it will upgrade to next version. When you have lv.6 fireball
    and lv.6 chainlightning, they will automatically combined into a lv.99 lengendary
    spell - chain explosion.

    In the game, your goal is to kill enemies, level
    up and survive to the end. There will be random quests poping up, and you need
    to find them as soon as possible. You can also collect gold by destroy boxes
    in the game.

    With gold, you can purchase permanent upgrade from shop in
    the main menu.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
